1. Which car makers produce at least 2 models?
   ```sql
   SELECT Maker, COUNT(Model) AS ModelCount FROM model_list GROUP BY Maker HAVING ModelCount >= 2;
   ```

2. How many car makers are there in total?
   ```sql
   SELECT COUNT(Id) AS TotalCarMakers FROM car_makers;
   ```

3. Which car makers produce more than 3 cars?
   ```sql
   SELECT Maker, COUNT(*) AS CarCount FROM cars_data GROUP BY Maker HAVING CarCount > 3;
   ```

4. List the id and maker of car makers which produce at least 2 models and more than 3 car makers.
   ```sql
   SELECT Maker, Id FROM car_makers WHERE Id IN (
       SELECT Maker FROM model_list GROUP BY Maker HAVING COUNT(Model) >= 2
   ) AND Id IN (
       SELECT Maker FROM cars_data GROUP BY Maker HAVING COUNT(*) > 3
   );
   ```

